  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AFRITAC is IMF&apos;s two regional programmes in Africa with focus on capacity development within the administration and management reform. It was transfered from the Ministry of Foreign Affairs to Sida in 2007. Most of the contribution is carried out by long term consultants and concerns all fields within administration and management and good governance.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AFRITAC &#xE4;r IMFs tv&#xE5; regionala program i Afrika med inriktning p&#xE5; kapacitetsuppbyggnad inom f&#xF6;rvaltningsreform och &#xF6;verf&#xF6;rdes till Sida fr&#xE5;n UD 2007. St&#xF6;rre delen av insatsen &#xE4;r genomf&#xF6;rd av l&#xE5;ngtidskonsulter och r&#xF6;r i princip samtliga &#xE4;mnen inom f&#xF6;rvaltning och god samh&#xE4;llsstyrning.</narrative>
  </description>
